## 🏆 LOYALTY TIER SYSTEM

### Automatic Tier Upgrades:

| Tier | Total Spent | Benefits |
|------|-------------|----------|
| 🥉 Bronze | $0 - $199 | 1 point per $1 spent |
| 🥈 Silver | $200 - $499 | 1 point per $1 + 5% discount |
| 🥇 Gold | $500 - $999 | 1 point per $1 + 10% discount |
| 💎 Platinum | $1000+ | 1 point per $1 + 15% discount + VIP perks |

**Tier is automatically calculated based on `totalSpent`**

---

## 💎 LOYALTY POINTS SYSTEM

### Earning Points:
- ✅ **$1 spent = 1 point** (automatic)
- ✅ Birthday bonus: 10-25 points
- ✅ Referral bonus: 50 points
- ✅ Special promotions

### Redeeming Points:
- 💰 100 points = $5 off
- 💰 200 points = $10 off
- 💰 500 points = $25 off

---

## 📊 CUSTOMER STATISTICS TRACKING

### Auto-Updated Stats:
- `totalSpent` - Lifetime spending
- `totalOrders` - Number of orders
- `averageOrderValue` - Average per order
- `lastOrderDate` - Last purchase date
- `loyaltyPoints` - Current points balance
- `loyaltyTier` - Current tier (auto-calculated)

