## 🎯 QUICK REFERENCE

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth Level |
|--------|----------|-------------|------------|
| POST | `/customers` | Create customer | Any staff |
| GET | `/customers` | Get all customers | Any staff |
| GET | `/customers/:id` | Get single customer | Any staff |
| GET | `/customers/search/phone/:phone` | Search by phone | Any staff |
| GET | `/customers/stats/overview` | Statistics | Admin/Manager |
| PUT | `/customers/:id` | Update customer | Any staff |
| DELETE | `/customers/:id` | Soft delete | Admin/Manager |
| PATCH | `/customers/:id/loyalty/add` | Add points | Any staff |
| PATCH | `/customers/:id/loyalty/redeem` | Redeem points | Any staff |
| PATCH | `/customers/:id/stats` | Update stats | Any staff |
| PATCH | `/customers/:id/vip` | Toggle VIP | Admin/Manager |

---

## ⚠️ IMPORTANT NOTES

1. **Phone numbers must be unique** - Cannot register same phone twice
2. **Email validation** - Must be valid email format if provided
3. **Auto-calculations** - Loyalty tier and average order value calculated automatically
4. **Soft delete** - Customers are deactivated, not permanently deleted
5. **Points auto-added** - 1 point per $1 spent when stats updated
6. **VIP status** - Can only be changed by Admin/Manager

