📋 Testing Checklist
1. 🔐 Authentication (/api/auth)

 POST /register - Register new user
 POST /login - Login
 GET /profile - Get profile (requires auth)
 PUT /profile - Update profile (requires auth)

2. 🍕 Products (/api/products)

 GET / - Get all products
 GET /:id - Get product by ID
 POST / - Create product (admin)
 PUT /:id - Update product (admin)
 DELETE /:id - Delete product (admin)
 PATCH /:id/availability - Toggle availability (admin)
 POST /:id/sizes - Add size (admin)
 DELETE /:id/sizes/:sizeId - Remove size (admin)

3. 📂 Categories (/api/products/categories)

 GET /all - Get all categories
 GET /:id - Get category by ID
 POST / - Create category (admin)
 PUT /:id - Update category (admin)
 DELETE /:id - Delete category (admin)

4. 📋 Orders (/api/orders)

 GET / - Get all orders
 GET /:id - Get order by ID
 POST / - Create order
 PUT /:id - Update order
 DELETE /:id - Cancel order
 PATCH /:id/status - Update order status
 POST /:id/items - Add item to order
 DELETE /:id/items/:itemId - Remove item
 GET /queue/current - Get current queue

5. 📦 Inventory (/api/inventory)

 GET / - Get all inventory
 GET /alerts - Low stock alerts
 GET /:id - Get inventory item
 POST / - Create inventory item (admin)
 PUT /:id - Update inventory item (admin)
 DELETE /:id - Delete inventory item (admin)
 POST /:id/restock - Restock item (admin)
 GET /:id/history - Get restock history

6. 👥 Customers (/api/customers)

 GET / - Get all customers
 GET /:id - Get customer by ID
 POST / - Create customer
 PUT /:id - Update customer
 DELETE /:id - Delete customer (admin)
 POST /:id/points - Add points
 POST /:id/favorites - Add favorite product
 DELETE /:id/favorites/:productId - Remove favorite
 GET /:id/orders - Get customer orders

7. 🍽️ Tables (/api/tables)

 GET / - Get all tables
 GET /:id - Get table by ID
 POST / - Create table (admin)
 PUT /:id - Update table (admin)
 DELETE /:id - Delete table (admin)
 PATCH /:id/status - Update table status
 POST /:id/reserve - Reserve table
 POST /:id/cancel-reservation - Cancel reservation
 POST /:id/move-order - Move order

8. 💳 Payments (/api/payments)

 GET / - Get all payments
 GET /:id - Get payment by ID
 POST / - Process payment
 PUT /:id - Update payment (admin)
 DELETE /:id - Delete payment (admin)
 POST /:id/refund - Refund payment (admin)
 GET /summary/daily - Daily summary

9. 👔 Staff (/api/staff)

 GET / - Get all staff (admin)
 GET /:id - Get staff by ID (admin)
 PUT /:id - Update staff (admin)
 DELETE /:id - Delete staff (admin)
