🔍 Query Parameters Examples
Filter Products
GET /api/products?category=CATEGORY_ID&search=coffee&isAvailable=true
Filter Orders
GET /api/orders?status=pending&type=dine_in&date=2024-01-15
Filter Customers
GET /api/customers?search=john&membershipLevel=gold
Filter Inventory
GET /api/inventory?lowStock=true&category=coffee-beans
Filter Payments
GET /api/payments?method=cash&status=completed&date=2024-01-15
Get Reports
GET /api/reports/best-selling?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-01-31&limit=10
GET /api/reports/profit-loss?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-01-31

