## 🎯 API Endpoints Overview

### Authentication
```
POST   /api/auth/register          Register new user
POST   /api/auth/login             Login
GET    /api/auth/profile           Get profile (auth required)
PUT    /api/auth/profile           Update profile (auth required)
```

### Products & Categories
```
GET    /api/products               Get all products
POST   /api/products               Create product (admin)
GET    /api/products/:id           Get product by ID
PUT    /api/products/:id           Update product (admin)
DELETE /api/products/:id           Delete product (admin)
PATCH  /api/products/:id/availability  Toggle availability (admin)

GET    /api/products/categories/all    Get all categories
POST   /api/products/categories        Create category (admin)
PUT    /api/products/categories/:id    Update category (admin)
DELETE /api/products/categories/:id    Delete category (admin)
```

### Orders
```
GET    /api/orders                 Get all orders
POST   /api/orders                 Create order
GET    /api/orders/:id             Get order by ID
PATCH  /api/orders/:id/status      Update order status
DELETE /api/orders/:id             Cancel order
GET    /api/orders/queue/current   Get current queue
```

### Inventory
```
GET    /api/inventory              Get all inventory
POST   /api/inventory              Create item (admin)
PUT    /api/inventory/:id          Update item (admin)
POST   /api/inventory/:id/restock  Restock item (admin)
GET    /api/inventory/alerts       Get low stock alerts
```

### Customers
```
GET    /api/customers              Get all customers
POST   /api/customers              Create customer
GET    /api/customers/:id          Get customer by ID
PUT    /api/customers/:id          Update customer
POST   /api/customers/:id/points   Add loyalty points
GET    /api/customers/:id/orders   Get customer orders
```

### Tables
```
GET    /api/tables                 Get all tables
POST   /api/tables                 Create table (admin)
PATCH  /api/tables/:id/status      Update table status
POST   /api/tables/:id/reserve     Reserve table
POST   /api/tables/:id/move-order  Move order to another table
```

### Payments
```
GET    /api/payments               Get all payments
POST   /api/payments               Process payment
POST   /api/payments/:id/refund    Refund payment (admin)
GET    /api/payments/summary/daily Get daily summary
```

### Staff
```
GET    /api/staff                  Get all staff (admin)
POST   /api/staff/check-in         Check in
POST   /api/staff/check-out        Check out
GET    /api/staff/attendance/all   Get attendance (admin)
GET    /api/staff/salary/calculate Calculate salary (admin)
```

### Reports
```
GET    /api/reports/daily          Daily sales report (admin)
GET    /api/reports/monthly        Monthly sales report (admin)
GET    /api/reports/best-selling   Best selling products (admin)
GET    /api/reports/profit-loss    Profit & loss statement (admin)
GET    /api/reports/customer-analytics  Customer analytics (admin)
```

